","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s5","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"MLP achieves 85.2% accuracy on MNIST, while MLP obtains 64.6% accuracy on AG News.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s6","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"MLP has an error rate of 32.4% on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s7","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"Transformer reaches 72% validation accuracy at epoch 7.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s8","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1(b), ResNet-18 outperforms GRU by 8.3 percentage points at epoch 4.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s9","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s10","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, ViT-S reaches 53.2% validation accuracy at epoch 1.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s11","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"ViT-S reaches about 70% validation accuracy at epoch 4 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_009_s12","report_id":"v3feat_009","text":"At epoch 4, the loss of ViT-S is 0.559.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null}]}